<title>USA: Equitable completes real estate unit sale.</title>
<headline>Equitable completes real estate unit sale.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Equitable Cos Inc said Tuesday that it has completed the previously announced sale of Equitable Real Estate Investment Management Inc to Lend Lease Corp Ltd for $400 million.</p>
<p>The sale includes the unit's investment management business, two property management subsidiaries, its mortgage division; and a REIT management firm.</p>
</text>
